#!/bin/sh
# GUI launcher under a name third-party apps may use. OmaStore reserves the
# commands "omastore", "omastored" and "omastore-gui" for itself and refuses
# to install an app whose declared executable has one of those names.
set -eu
here=$(CDPATH= cd -- "$(dirname -- "$0")" && pwd -P)
exec "$here/omastore-gui" "$@"
